<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">- Vidunda Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Mdamla</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mdamla</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mdamla</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mda</para>
  <para style="mt">Mdamla</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Mdamla ndo chitabu chilingulangusa luhala kuli kikala. Ulonzi awu kwa Chiebulaniya una mana ya “munhu yalinguwakungajiza wanhu.” Wasomile wenji wangukunda kota Solomoni ndo nakandika chitabu achi, ila wanji hawalingukunda kuwala mbuli ayi. Wone Solomoni ndo nakandika chitabu achi, ahyo chitabu achi chowa nachandichigwa kuli mhela wa hagati ha miyaka 970-931, Yesu yang'hali kupondigwa, ndo mhela uwele Solomoni nakekala. Wasomile wanji wangukunda kota munhu yunji ndo nakandika chitabu achi, kwa vila chitabu achi changutumiya ndonga ya chiutumagwa kusinda ndonga ya chiundewa (Mdamla 5:8-9). Wasomile awo wangijesa kota chitabu cha Mdamla nachandichigwa hamba ng'hatu kusinda mhela uwele Solomoni nakekala, hanji nayali hagati ha miyaka 400-200, Yesu yang'hali kupondigwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Mdamla changwaluka kwa kulonga kota chila chinhu ndo kota iyosi, kwa vila changwajilila himahima (Mdamla 1:2). Mbuli ayo ina mana kota ukomu wa hetwe na mijito ja hetwe ndo vya mhela uchefu hela na havilinguzeleka goya. Mbuli nyinji hali azo hatulinguweza kuzilongoza. Ndo mbuli inojile kikala na kupala kusangalala kuli vinhu vyouwele navyo (Mdamla 9:9). Chitabu changusinda kwa kulonga kota magazo na kusangalala kwa ukomu, ndo kumdumba Nguluwi na kuwinza malajizo ga heye (Mdamla 12:13). Ayo ndo mbuli inojile ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Msitali wa 1 mbaka wa 11 kuli sula ya 1 ya chitabu achi, jangumzelesa munhu yawele nakandika chitabu achi na uwanzi wake.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 1:12 mbaka sula ya 6:9 zangulonga kuwala kikala.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Sula ya 6:10 mbaka sula ya 12:8 zangulavya ulonzi unojile wa Mdamla.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Kuli kuduma, kuli sula ya 12:9-14 chitabu achi changusinda kwa kulonga kuwala kota kikala kweng'ha ndo kumdumba Nguluwi na kuwinza malajizo ga heye.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1" />
  <para style="s">Chila chinhu ndo kota iyosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1" />Awu ndo ulonzi wa Mdamla, mwana wa Daudi, mndewa wa Yelusalemu,<verse eid="ECC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2" />“Iyosi! Iyosi!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:2">Mdamla kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:2">“Iyosi! Munhu halinguweza kugalula chinhu muisi kwa mijito ja heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:2">kota vyoyalingulemwela kibata iyosi.”<verse eid="ECC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3" />Munhu kangupegwa choni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:3">kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja heye jeng'ha aha muisi?<verse eid="ECC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4" />Chila mhela wanhu wangubagama na wanhu wanji wangupondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:4">ila isi yangikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="ECC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5" />Isanya lyangulawaga na kuzingaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:5">nalyo lyanguditaga himahima kuhiluka leka lilawe kahi.<verse eid="ECC 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6" />Mbeho yanguputaga kulutila kusini na kugaluchila kasikazini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:6">yanguhiluchilaga hihyo chila mhela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:6">mazuwa gose yanguhiluchila kuli nzila zake.<verse eid="ECC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7" />Nzanda zeng'ha zanguchililika kulutila mbahali, ila bahali hailingumema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:7">Honhu hozilingulawa nzanda, zanguhilukaga kukula kahi.<verse eid="ECC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8" />Vinhu avyo vyeng'ha vyangwambuza wanhu kutoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:8">mzidi kusinda munhu vyoyoweza kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:8">iziho halilingutoka kulola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:8">na ikutu halilingiguta kuhulika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:8">na maya hagalingumala.<verse eid="ECC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9" />Chila chiwele baho, chowa baho kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:9">chila chiwele nachiditigwa, choditigwa kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:9">ahyo, haduhu chinhu chinyale ng'hatu muisi.<verse eid="ECC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10" />Hana choneche chiwele munhu koweza kulonga, “Ulole, chinhu achi ndo chinyale.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:10">Ila nachali baho kulawa katali ng'hatu, nachali baho mhela wa hetwe louwele ung'hali.<verse eid="ECC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11" />Wanhu wa mhela awu, hawoweza kuzikumbuchila mbuli ziwele nazikoleka katali ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:11">na wala wa mhela ulinguya, hawozikumbuchila mbuli zilingukoleka sambi.<verse eid="ECC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhala na uhadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12" />Heni, Mdamla, nandali mndewa wa Isilaeli, ako Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ECC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13" />Kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha nanuwila kilangusa luhala lweng'ha, gala geng'ha galingukoleka hasi ha ulanga. Nandilangusa kota Nguluwi nakawika itunyo likulu mchanya mwa munhu. <verse eid="ECC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14" />Nambona mbuli zeng'ha zilingukoleka muisi, ndo iyosi na ndo kota munhu yalingubilimisa mbeho hela. <verse eid="ECC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15" />Chila chibiniche hachiweza kugololwa, chila chiwele cha haduhu, huweza kuchiwaza. <verse eid="ECC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16" />Nandali ndichijesa nene baha, “Ulole, nandiwa mkulu na konjezeka kuli luhala kusinda yoneche yawele nakalongoza Yelusalemu lombele nding'hali kulongoza.”<verse eid="ECC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17" />Ahyo, nanuwila kikangaza kuvizela kunoga kwa luhala kusinda upoka, ila nandilangusa kota mbaka ali nalyo ndo kota kubilimisa mbeho hela. <verse eid="ECC 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18" />Kwa vila luhala lwinji lwangigalaga lunhwinhwi lukulu, kahi uwanzi houkonjezeka na masinzo gangonjezeka.<verse eid="ECC 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2" />
  <para style="s">Lufufu haluweza kigala kusangalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1" />Nandijesa mnhumbula mwa heni, “Goya, ndojeza kudita chila chinhu leka ndiwe na usangalalo.” Ila mbuli ayi ndo iyosi, ayo nayo nayoneka kota hailingutanza chinhu. <verse eid="ECC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2" />Nandonga, “Kuseka chila mhela ndo upoka na kulutilila kudita mbuli zilingundita sangalale hakulingugala utanzi wa mhela winji.” <verse eid="ECC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3" />Lombele ndipala luhala, nandijesa ng'hatu, hamba nanyamula kisangalaza kwa kunwa lukami divai. Nanyamula kunwa divai leka kona kota ndo goya kuli mhela awu uchefu wa kikala hano muisi.<verse eid="ECC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4" />Kahi nandita mbuli ng'hulu, ziwele ndo kizenjela ng'handa ng'hulu na kulima migunda mikulu ja mizabibu. <verse eid="ECC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5" />Nangongomanya vigunda na luga lwa mnvina na kunyala chila nhanzi ya migodi ja mafuza mgati mwake. <verse eid="ECC 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6" />Nangongomanya milamba ja kukungajiza mazi ga kuboholela migodi aji jiwele najali jikula goya. <verse eid="ECC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7" />Nangula wapogozi wadala na walume na wapogozi wanji nawapondigwa kuli ng'handa ya heni. Nandali kahi na vilundo vikulu vya misenga na ming'holo na mhene kusinda munhu yoneche yawele nayali yochikala Yelusalemu, mhela heni lombele nding'hali kulongoza. <verse eid="ECC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8" />Nandikungajizila sendi na zahabu kulawa kuli ng'hano za wandewa wa honhu hanji. Nandali na walingwimba walume na wadala, kahi nandali na waha, wawele nawali woisangalaza nhumbula ya mlume. <verse eid="ECC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9" />Nandali ndizeleka ng'hatu kusinda munhu yunji yoneche yawele nakandongola kikala Yelusalemu na nandali na luhala ng'hatu.<verse eid="ECC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10" />Silechile kuhola chinhu choneche chiwele meho ga heni nagali na maya nacho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:10">haduhu chinhu chinojile chiwele sijezile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:10">Nhumbula ya heni naisangalala kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja heni jeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:10">acho nachali ndo chonolo cha mbuli za heni zeng'ha zondiziditile.<verse eid="ECC 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11" />Vyombele ndijesa kuwala geng'ha gawele moko ga heni nagali gaditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:11">na gala gawele nandali nditunya leka kweneza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:11">ago geng'ha ndo iyosi, ndo kota kubilimisa mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:11">hakuwele na chinhu choneche cha mzidi hano muisi.<verse eid="ECC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhala na upoka ndo kota chinhu chimwe hela</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12" />Hamba nandiwuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:12">“Mndewa yunji kodita choni chiwele heni, mndewa Solomoni sichiditile?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:12">Hamba nanyaluka kiwhaniza kuwala luhala na lukwale na upoka.<verse eid="ECC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13" />Nambona kota luhala ndo lunoga lukami kusinda upoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:13">kota vila lumuli vyoluwele lunojile kusinda jiza.<verse eid="ECC 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14" />Munhu yawele na luhala kana meho kumutwi mwa heye, leka yone hoyojenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:14">naye mpoka howeza kona hoyojenda, kwa vila kangujenda kuli jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:14">ila hamba nambona kota weng'ha weli kuduma kwa hewo kwangiwhana.<verse eid="ECC 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15" />Hamba nandiwuza mnhumbula mwa heni, “Kuduma kwa mpoka kofika heni kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:15">ndowa na choni chinojile ng'hatu kwa kuwa na luhala?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:15">Ahyo nanyidichila mnhumbula mwa heni, “Ali nalyo ndo iyosi.”<verse eid="ECC 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16" />Kwa vila munhu yawele na luhala, ndo kota vyoiwele kwa mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:16">weng'ha weli wobagama, hokumbuchilwa kwa mhela winji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:16">Kuli mazuwa galinguya weng'ha wosemwigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 2:16">kota vila vyoyawele mpoka, yawele na luhala kahi kanguganigwa kubagama.<verse eid="ECC 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukola mijito jing'ang'ale hakulingutanza chinhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17" />Ahyo, nandikuzudila kikala, kwa vila mijito jilingukoleka muisi najali masinzo kwa heni. Geng'ha ago ndo iyosi, ndo kota kubilimisa mbeho. <verse eid="ECC 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18" />Nandichizudila chila chinhu chiwele nandali nditunyile hano muisi, kwa vila ndoganigwa ndimlechele yula yalinguya kulongoza hondibagama. <verse eid="ECC 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19" />Whaani yalinguvizela kota ayo kowa munhu yawele na luhala ama mpoka? Ila hanga kowa mpoka, heye ndo yawele kohalila vinhu vyeng'ha viwele nandikangaza ng'hatu na kwa luhala leka kuvipata. Ali nalyo ndo iyosi. <verse eid="ECC 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20" />Ahyo nhumbula ya heni nayaluka kugozola kuwala mijito jeng'ha jong'holile kwa kikangaza hano muisi, <verse eid="ECC 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21" />kwa vila munhu kanguweza kukola mijito ja heye kwa luhala na kwa uwanzi lukami, hamba koganigwa kumlechela vinhu vyeng'ha munhu yunji yawele havipalile kwa kitunya. Ali kahi ndo iyosi na ndo mbuli yihile ng'hatu. <verse eid="ECC 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22" />Munhu kopata choni kwa chiwalo cha magazo ga heye makulu na kitunya kwa kikangaza kuli mijito hano muisi? <verse eid="ECC 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23" />Mazuwa ga heye geng'ha ga mijito nagamema usungu na masinzo, mbaka kuli mhela wa nechilo nyhala za heye hazilingwesela. Ali nalyo ndo iyosi.<verse eid="ECC 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24" />Haduhu chinhu chinojile ng'hatu chiwele munhu koweza kudita mzidi wa kulya na kunwa na kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja heye. Ndangukunda kota aga twangupegwa na Nguluwi, <verse eid="ECC 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25" />kwa vila haduhu munhu yawele koweza kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha vinhu avyo mzidi wa heni. <verse eid="ECC 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26" />Kwa yula munhu yalingumnojeza Nguluwi, Nguluwi kangumpaga luhala na uwanzi na usangalalo, ila kwa yawele na gehile Nguluwi kangumpaga mijito ja kukungajiza lufufu na kuwika kuli ng'hano leka Nguluwi yamhe yula yalingunojezwa naye. Kukola mijito kwa hewo kwa kikangaza ndo iyosi, ndo kota kubilimisa mbeho.<verse eid="ECC 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3" />
  <para style="s">Chila mbuli ina mhela wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1" />Hana mhela kwa chiwalo cha chila mbuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:1">na kwa chila chilinguditigwa hasi ha ulanga.<verse eid="ECC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2" />Hana mhela wa kupondigwa na mhela wa kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:2">mhela wa kunyala na mhela wa kubeta ganyaligwe,<verse eid="ECC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3" />mhela wa kukopola na mhela wa kulohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:3">mhela wa kubomola na mhela wa kuzenga,<verse eid="ECC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4" />mhela wa kulila na mhela wa kuseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:4">mhela wa kulombocheza na mhela wa kuvina,<verse eid="ECC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5" />mhela wa kukungajiza na mhela wa kusambalula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:5">mhela wa kukumbatila na mhela wa kuleka kukumbatila,<verse eid="ECC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6" />mhela wa kupala na mhela wa kwajiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:6">mhela wa kuwika na mhela wa kutoza,<verse eid="ECC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7" />mhela wa kudadula mivalo na mhela wa kuhona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:7">mhela wa kunyamalila na mhela wa kulonga,<verse eid="ECC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8" />mhela wa kusangalala na mhela wa kuzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:8">mhela wa ngondo na mhela wa kikala goya.<verse eid="ECC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9" />Mkolamijito kopata chinhu chachi cha mzidi kwa chiwalo cha kikangaza kwa heye? <verse eid="ECC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10" />Nandijona mijito jing'ang'ale jiwele Nguluwi nakajiwika kwa chiwalo cha wanhu. <verse eid="ECC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11" />Nakadita chila chinhu chiwe chinojile kwa mhela wake. Nakatupa maya ga kugazela gawele golawila, ila hatupele kuvizela ng'hatu kuwala gala gawele Nguluwi nakagadita kulawa mwaluko mbaka kuduma. <verse eid="ECC 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12" />Nandivizela kota haduhu chiwele chinojile ng'hatu kwa wanhu kusinda kuwa na usangalalo na kudita ganojile mhela howowa wochikala. <verse eid="ECC 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13" />Tweng'ha twanguganigwa kunwa na kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja hetwe, kwa vila awo ndo utambichizo wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ECC 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14" />Ndanguvizela kota chila chinhu choyalingudita Nguluwi chochikala mazuwa gose, haduhu munhu yawele koweza konjeza ama kupunguza. Nguluwi kanguditaga ahyo leka wanhu wamdumbe heye. <verse eid="ECC 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15" />Choneche chiwele baho nachali baho, chila chiwele chowa baho nachali baho kulawa katali, naye Nguluwi kangugachemaga gala gakolile gahiluche kahi.<verse eid="ECC 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kowatagusa watanganiche na wehile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16" />Nambona chinhu chinji kahi muisi, mbaka kuli chitala, honhu hawele watagusa wanguganigwa kudita hachi, nawadita wihe winji. <verse eid="ECC 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17" />Nandali ndijesa, “Nguluwi kowahilika kuli utaguso weng'ha weli, watanganiche na wehile, kwa vila kowa na mhela kwa chiwalo cha chila mbuli, mhela wa kutagusa madito geng'ha.”<verse eid="ECC 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18" />Nandijesa kahi, “Nguluwi kanguwajezaga wanhu leka kuwalajila kota hewo ndo kota migongolo, <verse eid="ECC 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19" />kwa vila chilingulawila kwa wanhu ndo chilingulawila kwa migongolo. Vyojilingubagama migongolo ndo vyowalingubamaga wanhu, weng'ha wana lweselo lulingiwhana, wanhu wahela chinhu cha mzidi kusinda migongolo. Chila chinhu ndo iyosi. <verse eid="ECC 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20" />Weng'ha wangulutaga honhu halingiwhana, weng'ha wangulawaga kuli nhimbwisi na weng'ha wanguhilukaga kuli nhimbwisi. <verse eid="ECC 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21" />Whaani yalinguvizela ng'hatu kota muhe wa munhu wangulutaga kuchanya na muhe wa igongolo wangudulikaga hasi kuli misanga?”<verse eid="ECC 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22" />Ahyo nambona kota haduhu chinhu chiwele chinojile ng'hatu kwa munhu kusinda kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja heye. Haduhu yalinguweza kumhilula leka yoye kona chila chilinguya kuditigwa hoyobagama.<verse eid="ECC 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4" />
  <para style="s">Kubunzwa na magazo na kuwa uliyeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1" />Hamba nambona kahi kubunza kweng'ha kuwele nakuditigwa muisi. Nandigona mahozi ga yalingubunzwa kahela wa kumhembuliza. Yula yalingumbunza myage nayali na mong'ho nakwali haduhu wa kumhembuliza yalingubunzwa. <verse eid="ECC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2" />Nani nandonga kota fola kwa yula yawele nakabagama kusinda yula yawele mkomu. <verse eid="ECC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3" />Ila fola ng'hatu kwa yula yawele hopondigwa, kusinda wala weli wawele ndo mkomu na yabagame, kwa vila heye yawele hopondigwa kowa yang'hali kuwona wihe ulinguditigwa muisi.<verse eid="ECC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4" />Nandivizela chiwalo cha wanhu kukola mijito kwa kikangaza leka mijito ja hewo jiwe minji lukami, ndo kwa chiwalo cha kuwonela maya walingikalasa habehi na hewo. Ila ali nalyo ndo iyosi, ndo kota kubilimisa mbeho.<verse eid="ECC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5" />Mpoka halingugana kukola mijito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:5">ahyo, kangubagama kwa vila kanguwa kahela chilyo.<verse eid="ECC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6" />Fola kuwa na chinhu chido hamwe na kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:6">kusinda kuwa na vinhu vinji hamwe na kitunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 4:6">kwa vila ndo kota kubilimisa mbeho.<verse eid="ECC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7" />Nambona kahi chinhu chiyage chiwele ndo kota iyosi muisi. <verse eid="ECC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8" />Nakwali na munhu yawele nayali yaliyeka, hawele na mwana ne mng'holoze yoneche, ila halechile kukola mijito na halingiguta kwa lufufu lwa heye ne kwesela na kiwuza, “Ndangitunya ahi kwa chiwalo cha whaani? Lekachoni nani ndangibunza kusangalala?” Ali kahi ndo iyosi, ndo mijito jiwele na magazo!<verse eid="ECC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9" />Fola kuwa wanhu weli kusinda yumwe, kwa vila howowa hamwe wokola mijito goya kwa kitanza. <verse eid="ECC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10" />Wone yumwe hali hewo kogwa myage komwinula, ila wone munhu kogwa na kayeka, yowa ndo mbuli yihile ng'hatu kwa vila kowa haduhu wa kumtanza kwinuka. <verse eid="ECC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11" />Wone kuwe na chipute wanhu weli wowasa hamwe leka kigalila ivuche, ila munhu koweza ndaze kigalila ivuche heye yaliyeka? <verse eid="ECC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12" />Munhu yawele yaliyeka koweza kusumigwa na munhu yunji, ila wanhu weli woweza kumtowa na kumsumya munhu ayo. Kahi ng'weso itawigwe goya ng'hatu kwa nyuzi zidatu, haiweza kudumuka himahima.<verse eid="ECC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli zilingulutilila goya hazilingutanza chinhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13" />Fola msongolo mzunwa yawele na luhala kusinda mndewa sekulu mpoka yawele halingugana kubochela makanyo. <verse eid="ECC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14" />Mbuli za msongolo kota ayo zoweza kulutilila goya na hamba kuwa mndewa, hanga mhaza na mayake nawali wazunwa ama hanga heye nayali mchinweng'ho kwa mhela umwenga. <verse eid="ECC 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15" />Nandimona chila yumwe muisi yomuwinza chilongozi msongolo yawele nakoya na kuwa na mndewa hala mndewa loyabagame. <verse eid="ECC 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16" />Wanhu walingumuwinza nawali wenji mbaka hawawezile kuwazigwa. Ila wala wawele wokuya hamba hawoweza kunojezwa na heye. Ali nalyo ndo iyosi, ndo kota kubilimisa mbeho.<verse eid="ECC 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5" />
  <para style="s">Kilaha kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1" />Uwe uchilolela houluta na kuihejelela ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Fola kuluta hala na kilangusa kusinda kulavya nhambiko kota vyowalingudita wapoka, wanhu wohawagazele ganojile na gehile. <verse eid="ECC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2" />Wijese louwa ung'hali kulonga na uleche kilaha himahima hali Nguluwi, kwa vila Nguluwi ka kilanga nagwe kwa muisi. Ahyo uleche kulonga ulonzi winji. <verse eid="ECC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3" />Munhu vyoyowa yosanzalima ng'hatu, ndo vyoyolota na lizi lya mpoka ndo ulonzi winji.<verse eid="ECC 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4" />Wone wilahe kwa Nguluwi, uleche kukawila kweneza. Nguluwi halingunojezwa na wapoka. Weneze chowilahile. <verse eid="ECC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5" />Inoga kuleka kilaha kusinda kilaha hamba uleche kweneza. <verse eid="ECC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6" />Wilolele leka mlomo wa hegwe uleche kukwinjiza kuli gehile, hamba umlonjele mtambika kota hunuwile kudita chilaho kota acho. Lekachoni kumdita Nguluwi yazudile na kujiwifya mijito ja hegwe? <verse eid="ECC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7" />Kilaha kota kodita chinhu na kuleka kudita chinhu acho, ndo kota kulota kulihela utanzi. Ahyo, mbuli inojile ndo kumdumba Nguluwi.<verse eid="ECC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lufufu halulingutanza chinhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8" />Houwona wazunwa wangubunzigwa kuli isi kwa vila utaguso na hachi navyajilila, uleche kububuwala kwa chiwalo cha mbuli azo, kwa vila chila chilongozi yalinguwabunza wanhu awo, ka hali ulongozi wa mkulu yunji na mchanya mwa awo weng'ha hana vilongozi wanji wawele ndo wakulu ng'hatu kusinda hewo. <verse eid="ECC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9" />Mbena za isi ndo kwa chiwalo cha weng'ha, mbaka mndewa yuye kangulyaga kulawa kuli migunda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mbena za isi ndo kwa chiwalo cha weng'ha, mbaka mndewa yuye kangulyaga kulawa kuli migunda. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wasomile hawalinguizela goya mana ya msitali awu.</char></note><verse eid="ECC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10" />Yoneche yalingugana sendi hochiguta kwa sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:10">yoneche yalingugana lufufu hochiguta kwa choyawelenacho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:10">Ali nalyo kahi ndo kota iyosi.<verse eid="ECC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11" />Wone uwe na lufufu lwinji, wanhu wenji wogana uwape chilyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:11">Munhu halingupata mzidi wa lufufu lwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:11">kwa vila wanji wanguluhola kulawa kwa heye.<verse eid="ECC 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12" />Usinjizi wa mkola mijito ndo unoga, hanga yawe nakalya chido ama chinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:12">ila usinjizi wa yawele na lufufu ndo wa lunhwinhwi, kwa vila mzidi wa lufufu lwa heye lwangumtunyaga nechilo yeng'ha.<verse eid="ECC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13" />Nandiwona wihe ukulu muisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:13">Munhu kanguwa na lufufu, ila haluwele lunojile kwa heye,<verse eid="ECC 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14" />kwa vila mbuli yangulawila na kwambuza kwajilila kwa lufufu lwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:14">ahyo, hoyobagama kwanguwa haduhu chinhu chiwele chosigala kwa chiwalo cha uhalizi wa mwana wa heye.<verse eid="ECC 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15" />Loyapondigwe, hoyile na chinhu choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:15">na hoyobagama, howeza kuhola chinhu choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:15">chiwele nachilawa kuli mijito ja heye ja kikangaza.<verse eid="ECC 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16" />Mbuli ayi kahi ndo yiha ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:16">Munhu hoyopondigwa halinguya na chinhu muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:16">ahyo, hoyokuka aha muisi, kokuka ne chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:16">Nakakola mijito kwa kikangaza, ila halingupata chinhu chilingukala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="ECC 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17" />Kuli mazuwa ga kikala kwa heye kweng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 5:17">nakekala hasi ha ng'hungugu, kutweguka nhumbula na ng'halazi.<verse eid="ECC 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18" />Nandivizela kota inoga kwa munhu kulya na kunwa na kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja heye jing'ang'ale joyalingujikola muisi, kuli mazuwa mado ga ukomu wa heye goyapegwe na Nguluwi, kwa vila ndo hachi yake. <verse eid="ECC 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19" />Mzidi wa geng'ha, Nguluwi hoyomha munhu yoneche lufufu na kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha kutumiya vinhu avyo na kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja heye, vinhu avi ndo ndolendole kulawa kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="ECC 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 5:20" />Nguluwi kanguwaditaga wanhu wasangalale kwa kuwapa mijito, leka waleche kijesa kuwala mazuwa ga hewo ga ukomu vyogawele mado.<verse eid="ECC 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6" />
  <para style="s">Uleche kitumbila kuli lufufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1" />Nandiyona mbuli yihile yinji kahi muisi, ilinguwatunya ng'hatu wanhu. <verse eid="ECC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2" />Nguluwi kangumhaga munhu lufufu na lutogo, choneche choyalinguchonela maya, ila Nguluwi halingumdita munhu ayo yasangalale kwa chiwalo cha kutumiya vinhu avyo, ila mjenzi ndo yalingusangalala kwa chiwalo cha avyo. Ali nalyo ndo kota iyosi na ndo wihe ulingigala masinzo. <verse eid="ECC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3" />Hanga munhu koweza kuwa na wana miya imwe na wone naye koweza kikala miyaka minji, ila howeza kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha lufufu lwa heye, ndangulonga kota fola mwana yapondigwe yawele nakabagama, kusinda heye. <verse eid="ECC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4" />Ukomu wa mwana ayo ndo kota iyosi, kwa vila kangwajililaga kuli jiza na kuli jiza itagwa lyake lyangugubikwaga na kangusemwigwa. <verse eid="ECC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5" />Hanga hawezile kulyona isanya ne kuchizela chinhu choneche, kangwesela goya kusinda munhu ayo, <verse eid="ECC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6" />hanji munhu ayo kochikala miyaka elufu mbili (2,000) na mzidi, ila wone kolemwela kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha mbuli za heye zilingulutilila goya ziwele Nguluwi nakamha, yahawele ndo mbuli inojile kwa heye kuleka kupondigwa. Wanhu weng'ha wanguluta hali honhu hamwe, kuli chilaga.<verse eid="ECC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7" />Mijito jeng'ha ja kikangaza kwa munhu ndo kwa chiwalo cha chilyo cha heye hela, ila mhela weng'ha halinguweza kugutiza maya ga heye. <verse eid="ECC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8" />Ndaze, munhu yawele na luhala kana chinhu chachi cha mzidi kusinda mpoka? Ndaze, mzunwa kangupataga chinhu chachi cha mzidi kwa kuvizela kikala goya hali wanhu wanji? <verse eid="ECC 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9" />Fola kiguta kwa vinhu vyouwele navyo, kusinda kitunya kwa maya ga kugana vinhu vinji lukami. Kulutilila kugana vinhu vinji lukami ndo kota iyosi, ndo kota kubilimisa mbeho.<verse eid="ECC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10" />Lyoneche lilingulawila nalyamuligwa kulawa katali na choneche chilingulawila kwa munhu nachizeleka kulawa katali. Ahyo haduhu munhu yawele koweza kitwanza na Nguluwi yawele na mong'ho kusinda munhu. <verse eid="ECC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11" />Ulonzi vyouwa winji ndo vyouwa kota iyosi, kwa vila haulingigala chinhu choneche cha mzidi kwa munhu. <verse eid="ECC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12" />Twangikala kwa mhela uchefu hela na kwajilila kota isisila vyolilingwajilila kuli lumuli lwa isanya. Haduhu yalinguvizela choni cholawila muisi munhu hoyobagama.<verse eid="ECC 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7" />
  <para style="s">Luhala kuli kikala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1" />Fola itagwa liwele na lutogo lunojile kusinda lukuli luwele na unhunyhililo unojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:1">nalyo zuwa lya kubagama ndo linoga kusinda lya kupondigwa.<verse eid="ECC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2" />Fola kuluta kuli ng'handa ya walingulombocheza kusinda kuluta kuli ng'handa ya mnvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:2">kwa vila kubagama ndo kuduma kwa chila munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:2">wawele wakomu wanguganigwa kijesa kuwala mbuli ayo.<verse eid="ECC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3" />Fola kuwa na masinzo kusinda kuseka chila mhela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:3">kwa vila masinzo gangutudita tijese lukami kuwala ndaze vyotulinguganigwa kikala.<verse eid="ECC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4" />Yawele na luhala kangijesa kuwala masinzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:4">ila mpoka kangijesa kuwala kusangalala hela.<verse eid="ECC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5" />Fola kuhulichiza makanyo ga wawele na luhala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:5">kusinda kuhulichiza nzimbo za lutogo kulawa kwa wapoka.<verse eid="ECC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6" />Kuseka kwa mpoka kwangumala himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:6">ndo kota lizi lya miwa hojiwa jilakala kuli chiluli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:6">Ali nalyo ndo kota iyosi.<verse eid="ECC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7" />Kubunza kwangumditaga yawele na luhala yawe mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:7">na kubochela chinhu kwa chiwalo cha kwajiliza hachi, kwanguwifyaga nhumbula.<verse eid="ECC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8" />Fola kuduma kwa mbuli kusinda mwaluko wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:8">fola kwimilila kusinda kidaya.<verse eid="ECC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9" />Uleche kuzudila himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:9">kwa vila ng'halazi yangikalaga mgati mwa wapoka.<verse eid="ECC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10" />Uleche kulonga, “Mazuwa ga katali nagali ganojile kusinda mazuwa aga,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:10">kwa vila walihela luhala ndo wangulongaga ahyo.<verse eid="ECC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11" />Luhala ndo chinhu chinojile ng'hatu kota uhalizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:11">kwa vila lwanguwatanza wala walingikala.<verse eid="ECC 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12" />Kwamilwa na luhala ndo kota kwamilwa na sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:12">ila luhala ndo lunoga lukami kusinda sendi, kwa vila loweza kuulohola ukomu wa hegwe.<verse eid="ECC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13" />Wijese ng'hatu kuwala chila chinhu choyachiditile Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:13">Whaani yoweza kugolola chinhu choyachibinile Nguluwi?<verse eid="ECC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14" />Mhela mbuli hoziwa zinojile usangalale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:14">na wone mhela mbuli hoziwa vibi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:14">ukumbuchile kota Nguluwi yuye ndo yalingwambuza mbuli zinojile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:14">na ndo yuye kahi yalingwambuza mbuli zili vibi zilawile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:14">Ahyo, huweza kuvizela choni cholawila kwa hegwe kuli mhela ulinguya.<verse eid="ECC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15" />Kuli kikala kwa heni nambona mbuli mbili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:15">ziwele haziwele ubewe kwa heni kuzizela, kota kujeza kubata iyosi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:15">Nandiwona watanganiche wangubagama kuno wang'hali wasongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:15">na wehile wangulutilila kikala kwa mhela winji.<verse eid="ECC 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16" />Uleche kuwa yatanganiche lukami ama kuwa na luhala mzidi wa vyoilinguganigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:16">lekachoni utweguche nhumbula?<verse eid="ECC 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17" />Uleche kudita wihe mzidi ne kuwa mpoka lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:17">wone kodita ahyo, koweza kubagama kuno mhela wa hegwe haunafika.<verse eid="ECC 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18" />Wijeze kudita mbuli azo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:18">Munhu yalingumdumba Nguluwi kohulichiza makanyo geng'ha meli.<verse eid="ECC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19" />Wone kuna luhala, kowa na mong'ho lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:19">kusinda vilongozi kumi kuli muji.<verse eid="ECC 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20" />Haduhu yatanganiche muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:20">yalinguditaga ganojile mhela weng'ha ne kudita gehile.<verse eid="ECC 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21" />Uleche kupugajiza chila ulonzi uwele wanhu wangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:21">kwa vila wone udite ahyo, koweza kuhulika chitumagwa wa hegwe kangulonga ulonzi wihile ulingukuwala.<verse eid="ECC 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22" />Uleche kusemwa kota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:22">nagwe nakulonga ulonzi wihile kwa wanji.<verse eid="ECC 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23" />Kwa luhala lwa heni nandizijeza mbuli azi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:23">nandali ndigana kuwa munhu yawele na luhala, ila luhala nalwali kutali na heni.<verse eid="ECC 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24" />Yangoneka kota luhala lwa kutali ng'hatu kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:24">ndikomya, haduhu munhu yoneche yawele koweza kuvizela kuwala chila chinhu.<verse eid="ECC 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25" />Nanyamula kilangusa mbuli nyinji leka ndiwe na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:25">nandali ndigana kuvizela kuwala kikala vyokuwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:25">nandali ndigana kahi kuvizela mbuli za wihe na za upoka zilinguditigwa na wanhu.<verse eid="ECC 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26" />Nandichizela chinhu achi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:26">kota mdala mwihe ndo yehile kusinda kubagama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:26">Lukuli lwake na nhumbula ya heye ndo idiwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:26">Komgwiliza yalingudita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:26">ila yalingumdumba Nguluwi, howeza kugwilizwa.<verse eid="ECC 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27" />Achi ndo chinhu chiwele nandichizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:27">lombele ndijeza kilangusa ng'hatu kuwala vinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:27">kuwele ndo kujeza kuvizela chiwalo cha chila chinhu,<verse eid="ECC 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28" />nding'hali ndangupala, ila sipata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:28">nandali ndimpatile mlume yumwe yagoloche hali elufu imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:28">ila haduhuli mdala yumwe yagoloche hali wadala weng'ha.<verse eid="ECC 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29" />Ali liliyeka ndo ndilipatile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:29">Nguluwi nakawalumba wanhu wagoloche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 7:29">ila hewo nawazifika nzila nyinji za kudita wihe.<verse eid="ECC 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1" />Whaani yawele kota munhu yawele na luhala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:1">Whaani yalinguweza kutang'hula mbuli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:1">Luhala lwangukudita kumeho kwa munhu kusangalale.<verse eid="ECC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhulichize mndewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2" />Ndangulonga kota uhulichize ilajizo lya mndewa, kwa vila nawilaha kudita ahyo hali Nguluwi. <verse eid="ECC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3" />Uleche kuka himahima hali mndewa. Uleche kulewela mbuli yohambe ikundigwe, kwa vila mndewa kodita lyoneche yalinguligana. <verse eid="ECC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4" />Ulonzi wa mndewa ndo uwele na ludali lwa kuduma, whaani yoweza kumuuza, “Kwangudita choni?”<verse eid="ECC 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5" />Yoneche yawele kohulichiza ilajizo lya heye holumizwa naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:5">yawele na luhala kouzela mhela unojile wa kudita chinhu.<verse eid="ECC 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6" />Ena, chila chinhu china mhela wake na nzila zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:6">hanga munhu kangufichigwa na nongwa ng'hulu.<verse eid="ECC 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7" />Haduhu hali hetwe yalinguzizela mbuli za mazuwa galinguya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:7">haduhu yoweza kutulonjela mbuli zilinguya.<verse eid="ECC 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8" />Hatulizelele zuwa lya kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:8">na haduhu wawele woweza kuligalula zuwa alyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:8">Haduhu mwamizi yalingukundigwa kuka kuli ngondo mhela ngondo yangulutilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 8:8">na mwihe howeza kuloholigwa kulawa kuli madito ga heye gehile.<verse eid="ECC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9" />Geng'ha aga nandigona lombele ndichijesa kuwala chila chinhu chilinguditigwa muisi. Hana mhela munhu kangiditaga mkulu mchanya mwa wanji, kwa kudita ahyo kanguwatunyaga wanhu. <verse eid="ECC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10" />Nandiwona wehile wotiligwa, wala wawele nawazowela kwinjila na kulawa honhu helile na kupegwa lutogo kuli muji uwele nawali waditile wihe. Ali nalyo ndo kota iyosi.<verse eid="ECC 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11" />Hotuwona wehile wangudita wihe na hawalingugazigwa kwa chiwalo cha wihe wa hewo, mbuli ayo yangutudita tuwe na majesa ga kudita wihe. <verse eid="ECC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12" />Hanga mwihe kanguditaga wihe mala miya imwe na koweza kulutilila kikala lukami, ila ndangijesa kota fola kwa wanhu walingumhulichiza Nguluwi, wala walingumdumba Nguluwi. <verse eid="ECC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13" />Ila kwa vila wehile hawalingumdumba Nguluwi, mbuli za hewo haziweza kulutilila goya na hawochikala kwa mhela winji.<verse eid="ECC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14" />Hana mbuli iyage iwele ndo kota iyosi ilingulawila muisi. Watanganiche wangupegwa gala galinguganigwa kupegwa wehile na wehile wangupegwa galinguganigwa kupegwa watanganiche. Ndangulonga kota mbuli ayi kahi ndo kota iyosi. <verse eid="ECC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15" />Ahyo ndangulonga kota twanguganigwa kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha kikala, kwa vila haduhu mbuli inojile ng'hatu kwa munhu kusinda kulya na kunwa na kusangalala. Hamba kusangalala kowa hamwe na mijito jake kuli mazuwa geng'ha ga ukomu wa heye gawele nakapegwa na Nguluwi hano muisi. <verse eid="ECC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16" />Nanuwila kuwa munhu yawele na luhala na kupugajiza chila chinhu chiwele wanhu woweza kudita muisi, nandiwona wanhu wokola mijito jing'ang'ale nemisi na nechilo ne kuwasa. <verse eid="ECC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17" />Siwezile kuvizela choyalingudita Nguluwi. Hanga munhu kochikangaza kupala leka kuvizela, howeza. Hanga munhu yawele na luhala kangulonga kanguvizela, ndikomya halinguvizela.<verse eid="ECC 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9" />
  <para style="s">Kuduma kwa weng'ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1" />Nandijesa kwa chiwalo cha mbuli azi zeng'ha, hamba nandivizela kota Nguluwi kana ludali kwa wala wawele na luhala na watanganiche. Choneche choweza kulawila kwa yumwe wa hetwe, ahyo hatuweza kuvizela kota kikala kowa kunojile ama kwihile. <verse eid="ECC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2" />Weng'ha wana kuduma kulingiwhana, watanganiche na wehile na welile na wakokomoche na wala walingigala nhambiko na wohambe wegale nhambiko. Kota vyoiwele kwa wanojile ndo hihyo du vyoiwele kwa walingudita gehile na kota vyoiwele kwa wala walingilaha ndo hihyo du vyoiwele kwa walingudumba kilaha. <verse eid="ECC 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3" />Ayi ndo mbuli yihile ng'hatu hali zeng'ha zilingulawila hano muisi, kwa vila kuduma kukula kwanguwafikaga weng'ha. Kuli mhela weng'ha wa ukomu wa hewo, wanhu wangumemaga wihe na lukwale, hamba wangubagamaga. <verse eid="ECC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4" />Yoneche yawele hali wawele wakomu kana kitumbila, mbaka libwa likomu ndo fola kusinda isimba lifile.<verse eid="ECC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5" />Kwa vila wawele wakomu wanguvizela kota wobagama, ila wabagame hawalinguvizela choneche, hawalingubochela chonolo choneche mbaka kukumbuchilwa kwa hewo nakusemwigwa. <verse eid="ECC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6" />Igano lya hewo na kuzudila kwa hewo na fihi za hewo navyajilila hamwe na hewo, hawochihanza kahi kuli lyoneche lilinguditigwa hano muisi.<verse eid="ECC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7" />Ulute ukalye chilyo cha hegwe kwa kusangalala na unwe divai ya hegwe kwa nhumbula ya kusangalala, kwa vila Nguluwi kangukunda choulingudita. <verse eid="ECC 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8" />Uvale nguwo zinojile za mnvina na wibakalize mafuta mazuwa gose. <verse eid="ECC 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9" />Usangalale hamwe na mchewako kwa chiwalo cha ukomu wa hegwe kuli mazuwa geng'ha ga kikala kwa hegwe kuwele ndo kota iyosi koupegwe na Nguluwi hano muisi, kwa vila aho ndo honhu hako kuli ukomu na kuli mijito ja hegwe jing'ang'ale hano muisi. <verse eid="ECC 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10" />Ukole mijito kwa mong'ho wa hegwe weng'ha kuli chila chinhu choulingudita. Kuli mhela uchefu hela koluta kuli isi ya wabagame, kuwele kwahela mijito ne kiwika goya ne uwanzi ne luhala.<verse eid="ECC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11" />Nambona chinhu chinji kahi muisi. Hawawele walingubilima lukami wangusumya kuli kitwanza, ama wawele na mong'ho walingusumya kuli ngondo, ama wawele na luhala walinguwa na chilyo cha kuhega, ama wawele na nyhala nyinji walingupata lufufu, ama wawele na uwanzi walingupata uganililo, ila mhumu yanguwafikaga wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="ECC 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12" />Munhu halinguvizela kota mhela wa heye wofika nili. Kota vila somba vyozilingugwilizwa kuli utandawala ama kota videje vyovilingugwilizwa kuli idiwa, ndo hihyo du wanhu vyowalingugwilizwa na mhela wihile vyoulinguya ne kuvizela.<verse eid="ECC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhala ndo lunoga lukami kusinda upoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13" />Kahi nambona nhelo ayi ya luhala muisi, iwele nayali inojile lukami kwa heni. <verse eid="ECC 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14" />Nakwali na muji udodo uwele nawali na wanhu wachefu mgati mwake. Mndewa yumwe yawele na mong'ho nakoya na kuuzunguluta na kiwika goya kuutowa. <verse eid="ECC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15" />Kuli muji awo nakwali na munhu yumwe mzunwa ila nayali na luhala. Nakaulohola muji wula kwa luhala lwa heye, ila hakuwele na munhu yawele hamba nakamkumbuchila yula mzunwa. <verse eid="ECC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16" />Ahyo nandonga, “Luhala ndo lunoga lukami kusinda mong'ho.” Ila luhala lwa mzunwa nalubezigwa, haduhu yawele nakahulichiza ulonzi wa heye kahi.<verse eid="ECC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17" />Ulonzi wa uliholile wa yawele na luhala wanguhulichizwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 9:17">kusinda iyowe lya chilongozi wa wapoka.<verse eid="ECC 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18" />Luhala luna mong'ho lukami kusinda vinhu vya kitowela ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 9:18">ila wihe umwe wanguwifyaga ganojile menji.<verse eid="ECC 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1" />Ng'honzi imwe ifile mgati mwa ibuli lya unhunyhililo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:1">yangwambuzaga kunhunyhilila kunojile kwajilile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:1">Hihyo du, upoka udo wangwambuzaga luhala na lutogo kusumigwa.<verse eid="ECC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2" />Majesa ga munhu yawele na luhala gangumlongozaga munhu kudita ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:2">ila mpoka kangwajilizwaga na majesa ga heye.<verse eid="ECC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3" />Mbaka hoyojenda mnzila, mpoka kangoneka vyoyawele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:3">kangilajila kwa chila yumwe ndaze vyoyawele mpoka.<verse eid="ECC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4" />Chilongozi hoyowa na ng'halazi kwa chiwalo cha hegwe, uleche kuhaleka honhu hako ha mijito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:4">nongwa ng'hulu zoweza kulechelwa housindamala.<verse eid="ECC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5" />Hana wihe uwele nandiwona muisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:5">wihe ulingwambuzwa na vilongozi.<verse eid="ECC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6" />Wapoka wanguwichigwa kuli honhu ha kuchanya kuli ulongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:6">kuno wawele na lufufu wangubezigwa.<verse eid="ECC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7" />Nandiwona wapogozi wawele wakwinile falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:7">kuno wakulu wojenda kota wapogozi.<verse eid="ECC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8" />Yalingubawa isimo, hanji kogwa mgati mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:8">yalingubomola lukanzi lwa maganga, hanji kolumigwa na izoka.<verse eid="ECC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9" />Yalinguhongola maganga hanji kangulumizwa na ago maganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:9">yalingutema migodi hanji kangulumizwa na migodi ajo.<verse eid="ECC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10" />Wone iwago liwe lidujile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:10">mong'ho winji wanguganigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:10">ila uwanzi wodita mbuli imale himahima.<verse eid="ECC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11" />Wone izoka lyomluma mteleka mikwandi hoyowa yang'hali kupemba mluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:11">ayo mteleka mikwandi halinguganigwa kupegwa sendi.<verse eid="ECC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12" />Ulonzi wa yawele na luhala wangumtanza yula yalingulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:12">ila mpoka kangudumigwa na choyalingulonga.<verse eid="ECC 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13" />Mpoka ayo kangwalukaga kulonga ulonzi wa chipoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:13">hamba kangusindaga kwa kulonga ulonzi wa lukwale,<verse eid="ECC 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14" />mpoka kangulutilila kulonga ulonzi winji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:14">Whaani yoweza kulonga mbuli yachi yolawila hamba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:14">Haduhu yoneche yalinguvizela lilinguya.<verse eid="ECC 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15" />Mijito ja mpoka jangumtunyaga heye yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:15">halinguizela nzila ilinguluta kuli muji.<verse eid="ECC 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16" />Mbuli zihile zowafika wanhu wa isi wawele chilongozi wa hewo ndo msongolo mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:16">na wakulu wawo wangudita mnvina chila mhela.<verse eid="ECC 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17" />Motambichizwa hemwe wanhu wa isi muwele mndewa wa hemwe kowa na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:17">na muwele vilongozi wa hemwe wangudita mnvina kwa mhela uwichigwe hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:17">kwa chiwalo cha kiyipa mong'ho, ila haiwele kwa chiwalo cha kugala.<verse eid="ECC 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18" />Wone munhu yawe mgata, chinduwiko cha ng'handa chosegama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:18">kwa chiwalo acho, ng'handa ya heye yohulula na kugwa.<verse eid="ECC 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19" />Kulya chilyo chinojile na kunwa divai kwangutwambuza tusangalale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:19">ila twanguweza kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha vinhu avyo vyeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:19">wone tuwe na sendi za kugula vinhu avyo.<verse eid="ECC 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20" />Uleche kijesa kumpanjila mndewa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:20">ama yawele na lufufu, hanga kowa mchihengo cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:20">kwa vila videje vyohulika lizi lya hegwe houwa uliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 10:20">ama chilumbigwe chilinguguluka chowikula ulonzi wa hegwe.<verse eid="ECC 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11" />
  <para style="s">Choyalingudita munhu yawele na luhala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1" />Ugule na kuguza vinhu kuli isi ya chijenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:1">hanji hamba koweza kupata mzidi.<verse eid="ECC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2" />Wagawile honhu ha lufufu lwa hegwe wanhu saba, ena mbaka wanhu nane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:2">kwa vila haulinguvizela mbuli yachi yihile yolawila muisi.<verse eid="ECC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3" />Ng'hungugu yangigalaga nhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:3">na igodi lyangusigala bahala holigwile.<verse eid="ECC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4" />Wone kuna lunhwinhwi kuwala nhonya, haunyala nyhule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:4">kwa chiwalo acho, hauweza kubeta chinhu choneche.<verse eid="ECC 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5" />Kota vila vyohambe uvizele nzila ya mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:5">ama ndaze ukomu vyoulingwinjila kuli mizeje ja mwana mgati mwa munda mwa mamo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:5">hihyo du, huweza kujizela mijito ja Nguluwi, yavilumbile vinhu vyeng'ha.<verse eid="ECC 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6" />Unyale nyhadikwa za hegwe mitondo na uleche kuleka kunyala matinazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:6">kwa vila huvizelele nyhadikwa zachi zokota, za mitondo ama za matinazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:6">ama zeng'ha zokota goya.<verse eid="ECC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Mkumbuchile yakulumbile louwa ung'hali msongolo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7" />Lumuli lunoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:7">na kulyona isanya kwanguganojeza meho.<verse eid="ECC 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8" />Munhu hoyochikala kwa miyaka minji lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:8">kanguganigwa yasangalale kwa chiwalo cha ukomu awo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:8">Ila kahi yakumbuchile mazuwa ga jiza, kwa vila gowa menji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:8">Chila chinhu chilinguya ndo kota iyosi.<verse eid="ECC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9" />Gwa msongolo, usangalale kwa chiwalo cha usongolo wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:9">nhumbula ya hegwe isangalale louwa ung'hali kuli usongolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:9">Uwinze maya ga nhumbula ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:9">na choneche chiwele meho ga hegwe ganguchona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:9">ila uvizele kota Nguluwi kokutagusa kwa chiwalo cha ago geng'ha.<verse eid="ECC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10" />Ahyo lelo, wuse lunhwinhwi mnhumbula mwa hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:10">na utoze kutali magazo ga lukuli lwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 11:10">kwa vila mong'ho wa usongolo wangumala himahima kota iyosi.<verse eid="ECC 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12" />
  <para style="s">Mkumbuchile yakulumbile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1" />Mkumbuchile yakulumbile kuli mazuwa ga usongolo wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:1">logang'hali kuya mazuwa ga magazo, mhela houlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:1">“Silingusangalala kwa chiwalo cha kikala aku.”<verse eid="ECC 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2" />Mkumbuchile yakulumbile hala isanya na lumuli na nyelezi na nhondwe loviwa ving'hali kuwichigwa jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:2">mhela ng'hungugu loiwa ing'hali kuhiluka hala nhonya loitowile,<verse eid="ECC 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3" />mhela uwele moko galingukwamila gangukakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:3">mhela magulu ga hegwe hogowa ng'hochele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:3">na mizino ja hegwe ja kubalasila hojiwa hajilingutanza chinhu kwa chiwalo cha uchefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:3">na mhela meho ga kusunjilila kuli mitubuli hogowa gangubilabila.<verse eid="ECC 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4" />Mkumbuchile yakulumbile mhela uwele makutu ga hegwe hagoweza kuhulika goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:4">hauweza kulihulika lizi lya wanhu wawele kuli mijito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:4">mhela wa nechilo, hauweza kuwasa goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:4">ila kohulika videje hoviwa vikwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:4">ahyo, kokwinuka kwa chiwalo cha videje avyo,<verse eid="ECC 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5" />mhela uwele hegwe kodumba chinhu chinuche na kukabusa mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:5">mhela uwele kowa na nyimvi kota uluwa uzelu wa igodi lya mlozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:5">na houjenda kwangikwang'wala kota ndede itochile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:5">hegwe kowa ulihela maya kahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:5">Mhela awo ndo munhu koganigwa yalute kuli ng'handa ya heye ya mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:5">walingulombocheza wenji wowa chila honhu.<verse eid="ECC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6" />Mkumbuchile yakulumbile mhela ng'weso ya sendi ing'hali kudumuka kwa chiwalo cha kulala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:6">ama chisaye cha zahabu hochiwa ching'hali kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:6">mhela ibiga ling'hali kutulika kuli ideho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:6">iguludumu ling'hali kutulika kuli honhu ha kudeha mazi,<verse eid="ECC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7" />mhela lukuli holuhiluka kuli misanga kolulawile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:7">na muhe wohiluka kwa Nguluwi yaulumbile.<verse eid="ECC 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8" />Mdamla kangulonga, “Iyosi! Iyosi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:8">Chila chinhu ndo kota iyosi!”<verse eid="ECC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuduma kwa mbuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9" />Mdamla hawele na luhala hela, ila kahi nakawalangusa wanhu uwanzi. Nakejesa na kupugajiza nhelo nyinji na kuzandika. <verse eid="ECC 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10" />Mdamla nakapugajiza leka yawe na ulonzi wa kukomya na chila chiwele nakandika nachali chigoloche ng'hatu.<verse eid="ECC 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11" />Ulonzi wa munhu yawele na luhala ndo kota migodi jihongoche jiwele mdimi kangutumiya kulongozela migongolo. Kahi nhelo zilingulawa kwa mdimi yumwe, ndo kota vigingi vitowelelwe goya kuli misanga. <verse eid="ECC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12" />Mzidi wa ago, wilolele mwanangu! Haduhu kuduma kwa kwandika vitabu, nako kusoma ng'hatu kwangutunya lukuli.<verse eid="ECC 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13" />Ulonzi weng'ha naulonjigwa, ila naipona mbuli imwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:13">Mdumbe Nguluwi, ubatilile malajizo ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:13">kwa vila aji ndo mijito joyapegwe munhu.<verse eid="ECC 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14" />Nguluwi kogatagusa madito ga hetwe geng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 12:14">mbaka gala gotulingudita chinyele, gawe ganojile ama gehile.<verse eid="ECC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12" />
</usx>